  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:10.662" end="00:12.162" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
      <p begin="00:11.929" end="00:14.038" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you for one night, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:14.038" end="00:16.842" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:16.842" end="00:19.707" ttm:agent="v1">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take a ride (Take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.707" end="00:22.361" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'til we die</p>
      <p begin="00:22.361" end="00:23.861" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
      <p begin="00:23.229" end="00:25.562" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you for one night, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:25.562" end="00:28.447" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:28.447" end="00:31.506" ttm:agent="v1">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take a ride (Take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="00:31.506" end="00:34.622" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'til we die</p>
      <p begin="00:34.622" end="00:36.122" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up</p>
      <p begin="00:35.305" end="00:37.187" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, wait, wait, wait, wait (Hah)</p>
      <p begin="00:37.187" end="00:40.003" ttm:agent="v1">I can't deal with none of these hoes, they wanna link (Wanna link)</p>
      <p begin="00:40.003" end="00:42.473" ttm:agent="v1">They think that I'm Sonic the way I want a ring</p>
      <p begin="00:42.473" end="00:46.252" ttm:agent="v1">But girl, I ain't no simp, yeah, shawty, I'm a king</p>
      <p begin="00:46.252" end="00:47.752" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up</p>
      <p begin="00:46.780" end="00:48.389" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, wait, wait, wait, wait</p>
      <p begin="00:48.389" end="00:51.289" ttm:agent="v1">I can't deal with none of these hoes, they wanna link</p>
      <p begin="00:51.289" end="00:54.130" ttm:agent="v1">They think that I'm Sonic the way I want a ring (Nah, nah)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.130" end="00:56.036" ttm:agent="v1">But girl, I ain't no simp, yeah, shawty, I'm a king</p>
      <p begin="00:56.036" end="00:57.733" ttm:agent="v1">Okay, I pull up in that Wraith</p>
      <p begin="00:57.733" end="01:00.678" ttm:agent="v1">Diamonds on my neck and they look like lemonade</p>
      <p begin="01:00.678" end="01:03.515" ttm:agent="v1">I stay steady flexin', I ain't never ever change (Nah)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.515" end="01:06.337" ttm:agent="v1">Baby showin' love now, but now I know it's all fake (Fake)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.337" end="01:09.131" ttm:agent="v1">Shoutout all my day ones, y'all the reason that I'm stay (Stay)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.131" end="01:12.037" ttm:agent="v1">Shawty said she love me, I told that girl, &quot;Give me face&quot; (Give me face)</p>
      <p begin="01:12.037" end="01:14.921" ttm:agent="v1">These hoes, they be textin', but they want me for the fame (For the fame)</p>
      <p begin="01:14.921" end="01:17.794" ttm:agent="v1">Thinkin' they can get my heart, but it's locked in a safe (In a safe)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.794" end="01:19.806" ttm:agent="v1">I don't care about no love, I care 'bout gettin' paid</p>
      <p begin="01:19.806" end="01:21.306" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
      <p begin="01:20.722" end="01:22.889" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you for one night, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:22.889" end="01:25.692" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:25.692" end="01:28.544" ttm:agent="v1">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take a ride (Take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.544" end="01:31.334" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'til we die</p>
      <p begin="01:31.334" end="01:32.834" ttm:agent="v1">She don't lie</p>
      <p begin="01:32.300" end="01:34.464" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you for one night, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:34.464" end="01:37.238" ttm:agent="v1">We can watch a movie and we can get some fries, ayy</p>
      <p begin="01:37.238" end="01:40.159" ttm:agent="v1">Come and vibe with me, baby, we can take a ride (Take a ride)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.159" end="01:48.159" ttm:agent="v1">I just wanna love you, baby-baby, 'til we die</p>
      <p begin="01:49.306" end="01:50.806" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up</p>
      <p begin="01:50.004" end="01:52.068" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, wait, wait, wait, wait</p>
      <p begin="01:52.068" end="01:56.453" ttm:agent="v1">I can't deal with none of these hoes, they wanna link</p>
      <p begin="01:56.453" end="02:01.000" ttm:agent="v1">They think that I'm Sonic the way I want a ring (Nah, nah)</p>
      <p begin="02:01.000" end="02:05.000" ttm:agent="v1">But girl, I ain't no simp, yeah, shawty, I'm a king</p>
